OL,3,CWhat is the 'Viking Row' and why has
OL,4,Cit gone viral at the 2026 World Cup?
OL,6,FNorway fans have gone viral for their
OL,7,F'Viking row' celebration
OL,9,FEngland will face Norway in the World
OL,10,FCup 2026 quarterfinals after an epic 3-
OL,11,F2 victory against co-host Mexico in
OL,12,Fthe Azteca Stadium on Monday.
OL,14,FNorway has made history by reaching
OL,15,Fthe last eight for the first time at
OL,16,Fthe World Cup after beating Brazil 2-1
OL,17,Fin the Round of 18.
