OL,3,CWhat is the 'Viking Row' and why has
OL,4,Cit gone viral at the 2026 World Cup?
OL,6,FBut it is not just their performance
OL,7,Fthat has been making waves at the
OL,8,Ftournament. Norway's unique
OL,9,Fcelebration has taken over social
OL,10,Fmedia and captured the imagination of
OL,11,Ffootball fans around the world.
OL,13,FWhile England have celebrated their
OL,14,Fwins with rousing fan-led sing-a-longs
OL,15,Fof Oasis' Wonderwall, Norway have
OL,16,Fleant into the country's Viking
OL,17,Fheritage.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
