OL,3,CWhat is the 'Viking Row' and why has
OL,4,Cit gone viral at the 2026 World Cup?
OL,6,FThe 'Viking row' celebration involves
OL,7,Flarge groups of fans performing a
OL,8,Fsynchronised seated movement that
OL,9,Fmimics rowing a ship to the beat of a
OL,10,Fdrum, similar to the style of
OL,11,FIceland's famous 2017 "Viking Clap".
OL,13,FThe supporters, usually wearing Viking
OL,14,Fhelmets and the team's red-and-blue
OL,15,Fjerseys, row in unison, forward and
OL,16,Fbackward, to the steady beat of the
OL,17,Fdrum.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
