OL,3,CWhat is the 'Viking Row' and why has
OL,4,Cit gone viral at the 2026 World Cup?
OL,6,FAfter beating Senegal on June 23,
OL,7,FNorwegian striker Erling Haaland, the
OL,8,Fteam's top scorer, encouraged
OL,9,Fteammates to sit down on the pitch and
OL,10,Fdo the Viking Row while he banged on a
OL,11,Fdrum in celebration.
OL,13,FHaaland had earlier told Fox Sports
OL,14,Fthat he was a huge fan of the chant.
OL,16,F"I saw it online; it's gone completely
OL,17,Fviral," Haaland told Fox Sports.
OL,18,F"Martin (Odegaard) asked me before the
OL,19,Fgame: 'Do you think we should join
OL,20,Fin?' I said, 'If we win, let's do it,
OL,21,Fwhy not?'"
OL,26,@zD@IpmzD@JotzD@Rpn
