OL,3,CWhat is the 'Viking Row' and why has
OL,4,Cit gone viral at the 2026 World Cup?
OL,6,FBut where did this move come from?
OL,8,FSuperfan Ole Froystad, also known as
OL,9,FMr Row on social media, claims to have
OL,10,Ffounded this new tradition.
OL,12,FSpeaking to CBS, he said that the
OL,13,Fmotion is similar to what the Vikings
OL,14,Fwould have done as they sailed their
OL,15,Fships into the shore before battle.
OL,17,FFroystad has taken his trend from
OL,18,FBoston to Times Square in New York,
OL,19,Frepeatedly banging a drum and chanting
OL,20,F"row" to the crowd.
OL,26,@pD@Po|yD@Co|
