OL,3,CWhat is the 'Viking Row' and why has
OL,4,Cit gone viral at the 2026 World Cup?
OL,6,FDescribing the atmosphere in Boston to
OL,7,FCBS, he said everyone was "hugging,
OL,8,Fpartying, jumping and rowing".
OL,10,FThe trend is now so widespread that
OL,11,Fpoliticians were spotted doing the
OL,12,F'Viking row' in Norway's parliament,
OL,13,Falong with members of the royal family.
OL,15,FNorway fans are not the only ones
OL,16,Fgaining publicity for their actions
OL,17,Fthis World Cup.
OL,19,FThe Tartan Army became famous not only
OL,20,Ffor their bagpipes, but for their
OL,21,Fability to drink Boston pubs dry.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/7
